		{"id":"0670e662ff4a6785","type":"text","text":"  // 动态创建 script 标签（众安可回溯 SDK）\n  // 本地开发(dev)不加载：录制上报走公网 tscomtra_t，与本地业务无关，\n  // 且本地网络到该域名不通时会反复重试刷屏。test/prd 环境行为不变。\n  if (import.meta.env.VITE_APP_MODE !== 'dev') {\n    const script = document.createElement('script')\n    script.src = import.meta.env.VITE_API_ZHONGAN_HUISU // 读取环境变量\n    script.async = true // 可选：异步加载\n    script.onload = () => {\n      console.log('众安回溯脚本加载完成......')\n    }\n    document.head.appendChild(script)\n  }","x":-22647,"y":-104,"width":250,"height":60},
