		{"id":"b86aa9690479a9fe","type":"text","text":"CHM 只能保证单个方法线程安全，**复合操作依然不安全**（例如`if(!containsKey) put`）","x":74,"y":473,"width":446,"height":50},
		{"id":"1a2a0cc58b7d0839","type":"text","text":"具有锁属性的容器CHM（JDK1.8 CHM = synchronized + CAS）","x":53,"y":622,"width":289,"height":50},
		{"id":"f573e8f3cd279eb4","type":"text","text":"- ReentrantLock：显式可重入锁，灵活支持 tryLock、可中断、公平锁；","x":260,"y":698,"width":320,"height":50},
		{"id":"2060b9422eea5a55","type":"text","text":"显示手动可重入","x":53,"y":711,"width":145,"height":50},
		{"id":"90b675e21e070d76","type":"text","text":"1. `synchronized`：抢不到锁，**线程直接阻塞，一直等，不能超时，不能主动放弃**。\n2. `tryLock()`：可以**尝试获取、超时放弃、避免死锁**。","x":374,"y":540,"width":452,"height":96},
		{"id":"5dfef54db26ebe7e","type":"text","text":"乐观锁，不阻塞线程","x":430,"y":866,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7f4d5fd94dd511f8","type":"text","text":"- ReentrantReadWriteLock：读写分离锁，读共享、写互斥，适合读多写少场景。","x":260,"y":776,"width":407,"height":75},
		{"id":"0589fa1069074b53","type":"text","text":"默认竞争不公平锁，先来后到是公平锁","x":-235,"y":510,"width":250,"height":50},
